# ==============================================================================
# US-Mainland-One — environment variable NAMES ONLY (2026-09-29, desk import)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Real values live ONLY in /home/ubuntu/.env on the AWS host (read by
# automations/rr-rootserver-poller.service EnvironmentFile= and communications/*/poll.py)
# or in the desk service environment. `.env` / `.env.*` are gitignored; this file is
# whitelisted by `!.env.example`. NEVER put a value on any line below.
# Destination chat/channel IDs already present in communications/.env.example.
# ==============================================================================

# ---- Communications (AWS /home/ubuntu/.env) ----
